# 箭头表示父子关系；节点上的两组序号表示从左到右的访问顺序。
direction: down

**.style.font-size: 20
**.style.border-radius: 10
(** -> **)[*].style.font-size: 18

root: 库存分类\nDFS ① · BFS ① {
  style.fill: "#f4f8ff"
}
equipment: 设备\nDFS ② · BFS ② {
  style.fill: "#f4f8ff"
}
accessories: 配件\nDFS ⑥ · BFS ③ {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}
peripherals: 外设\nDFS ③ · BFS ④ {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}
screens: 显示器\nDFS ④ · BFS ⑤ {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}
audio: 音频\nDFS ⑤ · BFS ⑥ {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}

root -> accessories
root -> equipment
equipment -> audio
equipment -> screens
equipment -> peripherals
